    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0023_649ca84dd7d0.png\" style=\"width: 218px; height: 150px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Anti-depressant</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0023_056d39cb2967.png\" style=\"width: 173px; height: 150px;\" />​​​​​​​</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>550</mn></math>&nbsp;times sweeter than cane sugar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0023_02e69c1c18cb.png\" style=\"width: 223px; height: 90px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Narcotic analgesic</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0023_977f3d59e74b.png\" style=\"width: 149px; height: 150px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Antiseptic</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
